# Web3Forms — free contact-form backend (https://web3forms.com)
# 1. Go to https://web3forms.com and enter your email
# 2. Copy the access key they send you and paste it below
# 3. Copy this file to ".env" (gitignored). This access key is public in the built app.
# 4. Enable hCaptcha in your Web3Forms dashboard to enforce verification server-side.
VITE_WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY=your-access-key-here
